    { title: "Data-centre exit", line: "310 services, 14 waves, 26 months. Order API availability: 99.98% over the programme.", tags: ["Kestrel Freight", "2020–2022", "Illustration"], place: "Rotterdam", year: 2022, kind: "list", more: "I wrote the plan and sequenced the move out of two data centres; about 60 engineers worked across teams. Dependency maps and rehearsed rollbacks came first. Shadow reads, dual writes and weighted routing preceded a two-week soak. Both sites closed on schedule. The measured 99.98% covers the Order API over 26 months; there were two internal incidents, each under ten minutes. Any scene graphic is an illustration, not internal telemetry." },
